```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>New Reply to Your Question | Elearning</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f7fb;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        .email-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 15px;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        /* Header */

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed);
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #c4b5fd;
        }

        .notification-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 25px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .header p {
            margin: 10px 0 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #e0e7ff;
        }

        /* Content */

        .content {
            padding: 35px 30px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #374151;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin: 0 0 25px;
        }

        .greeting strong {
            color: #111827;
        }

        /* Notification Card */

        .notification-card {
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .card-header {
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }

        .card-label {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background-color: #ede9fe;
            color: #6d28d9;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .card-body {
            padding: 22px 20px;
        }

        .course-title-label {
            margin: 0 0 7px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .course-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #111827;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .reply-message {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 15px 17px;
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            border-left: 4px solid #4f46e5;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #4b5563;
        }

        /* CTA */

        .cta-wrapper {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0 15px;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            background-color: #4f46e5;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            background-color: #4338ca;
        }

        .cta-description {
            margin: 12px 0 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        /* Bottom Message */

        .community-message {
            margin-top: 28px;
            padding: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .community-message p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        /* Footer */

        .footer {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding: 25px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        .footer strong {
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        .footer-links {
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #6d28d9;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* Mobile */

        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {

            .email-wrapper {
                padding: 15px 8px;
            }

            .header {
                padding: 28px 20px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 22px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 25px 18px;
            }

            .notification-card {
                margin: 20px 0;
            }

            .card-body {
                padding: 18px 16px;
            }

            .course-title {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .footer {
                padding: 22px 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="email-wrapper">

        <div class="email-container">

            <!-- Header -->

            <div class="header">

                <div class="logo">
                    Elearning<span>.</span>
                </div>

                <div class="notification-icon">
                    💬
                </div>

                <h1>Someone Replied to Your Question</h1>

                <p>There's a new response waiting for you.</p>

            </div>


            <!-- Main Content -->

            <div class="content">

                <p class="greeting">
                    Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
                </p>

                <p class="greeting">
                    Great news! Someone has replied to your question in one
                    of your courses. You can now continue the conversation
                    and get the clarification you're looking for.
                </p>


                <!-- Notification Card -->

                <div class="notification-card">

                    <div class="card-header">

                        <span class="card-label">
                            New Reply
                        </span>

                    </div>

                    <div class="card-body">

                        <p class="course-title-label">
                            Video
                        </p>

                        <h2 class="course-title">
                            <%= title %>
                        </h2>

                        <div class="reply-message">
                            💬 A new reply has been added to your question.
                            Log in to your Elearning account to read the
                            response and continue the discussion.
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- CTA -->

                <div class="cta-wrapper">

                    <a href="#" class="cta-button">
                        View Reply
                    </a>

                    <p class="cta-description">
                        Log in to your account to view the full conversation.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <!-- Community Message -->

                <div class="community-message">

                    <p>
                        Learning is better when we learn together.
                        Keep asking questions, sharing ideas, and
                        making progress. 🚀
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- Footer -->

            <div class="footer">

                <p>
                    You're receiving this email because you have
                    an active learning account with
                    <strong>Elearning</strong>.
                </p>

                <p>
                    If you have any questions, please contact our support team.
                </p>

                <div class="footer-links">
                    <a href="#">
                        Visit Elearning
                    </a>
                </div>

                <p style="margin-top: 15px;">
                    © 2026 Elearning. All rights reserved.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>

</html>
```
